sVKlxt8IfGxdTba-CTr68ggh1mpaDW4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5zkjgQhN1F2bilt3DPhbywiO3pFr-3iuFZKmrD3GWbQA&oe=6A032FB2"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot(1)_2560_1440.png", "id": "2100665936973153", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982680_2100665940306486_5664456920141678252_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BXbHer62cy4Q7kNvwHCynSs&_nc_oc=AdoYTNTIeNGR0tEx7HxU_wZ40eAyS-_jYEix2bSExNZoxwqYx7pp-mythsLUPk1aDEY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7wk5-CcAvul_x2Zw2EePVwKVvZnL-FwNHOcr2QX7L3DA&oe=6A031CD7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image.png", "id": "368600119311127", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_368600122644460_5598028405797075028_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mb3tm2-UgNMQ7kNvwEfD6qE&_nc_oc=AdqJ-xzu3di-mJW1knRyNNkwiFZ66QKGlg2tjnDzzh6BwEk2zsh9EhJtk-ZkXv-eSy4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7cti0Zx5288jieU-GJO-__Srbl_jP3POOPJgyHf3OWiw&oe=6A032215"}, "display_name": "2035 Carbon neutrality of smart green city", "keywords": [], "long_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths.\n\n1. Experience goal\n- Discover specific career topics in promising future industries and occupations against the backdrop of a smart green city in 2035\n- Explore a future path by experiencing a space for carbon neutrality\n- Learn about the need for carbon neutrality and what young people can do\n- Learn about core underlying technologies such as realistic content technology provided as an experience\n\n2. Characteristics of content\n- First-person perspective in which the experiencer becomes the main character\n- 7-step composition according to the actual experience process\n- Developed based on standing only\n- Movement and manipulation using the Oculus Controller\n- Estimated experience time of about 20 to 30 minutes\n\n3. 7-step configuration\nSTEP 1 Instructions on how to operate\nSTEP 2 Meeting with the UN Youth Delegation\nSTEP 3 Practicing carbon neutrality in urban forests\nSTEP 4 Implementation of carbon neutrality in wind power plants\nSTEP 5 Carbon neutrality practice at the East Coast carbon storage site\nSTEP 6 Think\nSTEP 7 Finishing\n", "short_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900.png", "id": "7527653000591853", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_7527653007258519_8435369833685824333_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lLvZfBh5-HkQ7kNvwFoPWyG&_nc_oc=AdrrbFmgiox2IECpmHQ9zYUNv2U5-Q0FeRoiUmwkX2q-QznpvHKaHFQNhVvU86bDHeg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4FhsxLgLergyhSpRgrHohF7z88UIfY62MA3P9t3i1Eow&oe=6A0335C2"}, {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1452940842279363", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031355_1452940845612696_1891464877969558457_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DiHF-6JfbmcQ7kNvwGsGlru&_nc_oc=AdpoxU1ha7TKtLYpMGNYnet0P59UF_tGu9txUUGkk63iWhF_gh0JE_mrCVIZ8MUryhQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4B2w1cmw_ly0ZWC1Y5kqIQPE4py8_olkZpz5fxnkS4jQ&oe=6A031C44"}, {"file_name": "Portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "959181839136200", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566686_959181842469533_2388841801262298119_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZyRoQ_X9qkcQ7kNvwFCRyyE&_nc_oc=AdqsotGYkqKxiexb8Q6ngI2j6V8I_wnbN9P__GHr_BtXkMCNZKc4GIwTu8SMHvi